# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Captures under supabase/_capture/ are verbatim records of what is live in
# production, checkable against an md5 the database itself computed. Some
# function bodies genuinely contain CRLF (the piece-control *_impl functions),
# so the `* text=auto` rule above would rewrite 446 bytes and break that check.
# `-text` (not `binary`) keeps the bytes exact while keeping the files diffable.
supabase/_capture/** -text
